# 高频词汇 List04
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024恋练有词
# 描述: 高频词汇List04核心词汇

{{exclude}}{/ɪkˈskluːd/}{排除；排斥}{Children under 12 are excluded from the competition.}}
{{execute}}{/ˈeksɪkjuːt/}{执行；实施}{The team executed the plan with precision.}}
{{expand}}{/ɪkˈspænd/}{扩展；膨胀}{The company plans to expand into European markets.}}
{{expect}}{/ɪkˈspekt/}{预期；期望}{We expect the results to be published next month.}}
{{expense}}{/ɪkˈspens/}{费用；开支}{Travel expenses will be reimbursed by the company.}}
{{experiment}}{/ɪkˈsperɪmənt/}{实验；试验}{The experiment produced surprising and valuable results.}}
{{explain}}{/ɪkˈspleɪn/}{解释；说明}{The professor explained the concept clearly.}}
{{exploit}}{/ɪkˈsplɔɪt/}{开发；剥削}{We should exploit every opportunity to improve efficiency.}}
{{explore}}{/ɪkˈsplɔːr/}{探索；考察}{Scientists continue to explore the depths of the ocean.}}
{{expose}}{/ɪkˈspəʊz/}{暴露；揭露}{The investigation exposed widespread corruption.}}
{{extend}}{/ɪkˈstend/}{延伸；扩展}{The company extended the warranty period to three years.}}
{{external}}{/ɪkˈstɜːnl/}{外部的；外面的}{External consultants were brought in to review the process.}}
{{facilitate}}{/fəˈsɪlɪteɪt/}{促进；使便利}{The new platform facilitates collaboration between teams.}}
{{factor}}{/ˈfæktər/}{因素；因子}{Cost is an important factor in the decision-making process.}}
{{feature}}{/ˈfiːtʃər/}{特征；特色}{The app's best feature is its simplicity.}}
{{figure}}{/ˈfɪɡər/}{数字；人物；身材}{The latest figures show a 10% increase in sales.}}
{{flexible}}{/ˈfleksəbl/}{灵活的；可弯曲的}{The company offers flexible working hours.}}
{{focus}}{/ˈfəʊkəs/}{焦点；集中}{The report focuses on three key areas of reform.}}
{{forecast}}{/ˈfɔːkɑːst/}{预测；预报}{Economists forecast steady growth for the coming year.}}
{{form}}{/fɔːm/}{形式；表格；形成}{Education takes many different forms around the world.}}
{{formula}}{/ˈfɔːmjələ/}{公式；配方}{The scientist derived a new formula for the calculation.}}
{{foundation}}{/faʊnˈdeɪʃn/}{基础；基金会}{Trust is the foundation of any successful relationship.}}
{{function}}{/ˈfʌŋkʃn/}{功能；函数}{The function of the committee is to oversee policy.}}
{{fund}}{/fʌnd/}{基金；资助}{The project was funded by a government grant.}}
{{fundamental}}{/ˌfʌndəˈmentl/}{基本的；根本的}{Access to clean water is a fundamental human right.}}
{{generate}}{/ˈdʒenəreɪt/}{产生；发生}{The new policy is expected to generate thousands of jobs.}}
{{global}}{/ˈɡləʊbl/}{全球的；全面的}{The pandemic highlighted the need for global cooperation.}}
{{goal}}{/ɡəʊl/}{目标；目的}{The main goal is to reduce carbon emissions by 50%.}}
{{grant}}{/ɡrɑːnt/}{授予；拨款；助学金}{The researcher received a grant to study climate change.}}
{{guarantee}}{/ˌɡærənˈtiː/}{保证；担保}{The product comes with a money-back guarantee.}}
